  Nodes:
  - NodeID: Start
    SpeakerName: Lan (Street Food Vendor)
    Text: "If it wasn't for Tuan Anh slipping me some of his allowance, I\u2019d
      have packed up this stall weeks ago."
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 1
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 1
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: So the "Mayor's Son" is actually your secret investor now?
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 2
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 3
    SpeakerName: Lan (Street Food Vendor)
    Text: "Call it what you want, but he\u2019s the only reason I can afford fresh
      supplies. He\u2019s reckless, sure, but he has a big heart when the rent is
      due."
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 4
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 4
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: I guess having a boyfriend with a rich dad has its perks.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 5
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 5
    SpeakerName: Lan (Street Food Vendor)
    Text: "It\u2019s called survival, bro. He might be a handful, but he keeps the
      lights on here."
    Choices: []
